ilt by Toyotomi Hideyoshi\u0002豚の三枚肉を泡盛や黒糖で甘辛く煮込んだ沖縄の郷土料理。とろける食感が魅力。\u0001An Okinawan dish of pork belly simmered in awamori and brown sugar until meltingly tender.\u0002豚まん\u0001Butaman\u0002豚骨ラーメンの本場。濃厚でクリーミーなスープ\u0001Home of tonkotsu ramen with rich and creamy soup\u0002象の鼻のような絶壁と青い海の絶景\u0001Spectacular cliff like an elephant's trunk with blue sea views\u0002豪華七夕飾り\u0001Gorgeous Tanabata Decorations\u0002豪華山車\u0001Gorgeous Floats\u0002豪華山鉾\u0001Luxurious Floats\u0002豪華曳山\u0001Gorgeous Floats\u0002豪華絢爛な山車が練り歩く八戸最大の祭り。精巧な人形と美しい装飾が見どころです。\u0001Hachinohe's largest festival featuring gorgeous floats parading through the streets. Elaborate dolls and beautiful decorations are the highlights.\u0002豪華絢爛な山車が練り歩く新庄の夏祭り。歌舞伎や歴史上の名場面を再現した山車が見どころです。\u0001Shinjo's summer festival featuring gorgeous floats parading through the streets. Floats recreating Kabuki and historical scenes are the highlights.\u0002豪華絢爛な山車と神輿が練り歩く花巻の秋祭り。400年以上の歴史を持つ伝統ある祭りです。\u0001Hanamaki's autumn festival featuring gorgeous floats and portable shrines parading through the streets. A traditional festival with over 400 years of history.\u0002豪華絢爛な曳山が練り歩く小松の春祭り。子供歌舞伎の上演でも有名です。\u0001Komatsu's spring festival featuring gorgeous floats parading through the streets. Also famous for children's kabuki performances.\u0002赤こんにゃく\u0001Red Konnyaku\u0002赤城山\u0001Mount Akagi\u0002赤白の美しい電波塔\u0001Beautiful red and white radio tower\u0002赤福\u0001Akafuku\u0002越中八尾に伝わる優雅な踊りの祭り。哀愁を帯びた胡弓の音色に合わせて踊る幻想的な祭りです。\u0001An elegant dancing festival passed down in Etchu Yatsuo. A mystical festival where dancers perform to the melancholic sound of the kokyu (bowed string instrument).\u0002越前そば\u0001Echizen Soba\u0002越前ガニ\u0001Echizen Crab\u0002越前和紙\u0001Echizen Washi\u0002越後まつり\u0001Echigo Festival\u0002越後一宮の古社\u0001Ancient shrine of Echigo Province\u0002越後姫いちごサンド\u0001Echigo-hime Strawberry Sandwich\u0002足利フラワーパーク\u0001Ashikaga Flower Park\u0002足利フラワーパーク藤まつり\u0001Ashikaga Flow")
